WEBVTT

00:00:00.021 --> 00:00:04.511
THE OBSESSIVE SCIENTIST

00:00:05.961 --> 00:00:07.211
Long ago,

00:00:07.671 --> 00:00:10.421
there lived a brilliant young scientist.

00:00:13.931 --> 00:00:16.891
By virtue of his astonishing genius,

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:19.511
he made many contributions
to human knowledge.

00:00:23.181 --> 00:00:28.691
However, he eventually became disillusioned with the world.

00:00:30.821 --> 00:00:36.411
Though constantly showered with praise
for the brilliance of his mind,

00:00:35.411 --> 00:00:40.371
Professor Genus Ba

00:00:35.411 --> 00:00:40.371
nished fro

00:00:35.411 --> 00:00:40.371
m Scientific Society

00:00:35.411 --> 00:00:40.371
Deranged Gene Experiments...

00:00:37.031 --> 00:00:40.371
none of his ideas or theories ever received

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.411
any support from the scientific community.

00:00:45.791 --> 00:00:48.381
"We should strive not to advance civilization,

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:51.801
but to drive forward the evolution of the human species."

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:55.761
That was his lifelong dream,

00:00:55.761 --> 00:00:59.301
but not a single person
came forward to help him fulfill it.

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:01.311
Damn these apes!

00:01:01.931 --> 00:01:05.561
"Dangerous ideas"? How dare they
write about me as if I were some freak!

00:01:06.351 --> 00:01:11.321
Do they really think humans have come this far by avoiding risks?

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:15.451
Idiots who think they no longer need to evolve

00:01:16.151 --> 00:01:19.241
have no right to pass on their genes!

00:01:19.241 --> 00:01:23.241
Of course, this plan was always for my own sake.

00:01:23.241 --> 00:01:26.041
Even if I must do it alone, I will do it!

00:01:30.041 --> 00:01:33.091
Thereafter, he devoted himself to his research.

00:01:33.091 --> 00:01:37.631
It was only after he turned 70 that his efforts began to yield results.

00:01:45.391 --> 00:01:49.151
First, the scientist regained his youth.

00:01:49.151 --> 00:01:52.901
Next, he began cloning himself.

00:01:53.861 --> 00:01:57.741
He named his laboratory the House of Evolution,

00:01:57.741 --> 00:01:59.531
and together with his clones,

00:01:59.531 --> 00:02:04.741
he conducted countless experiments with animals to create new species.

00:02:04.741 --> 00:02:07.711
Eventually, his experiments shifted to human subjects—

00:02:07.711 --> 00:02:09.171
This is taking too long!

00:02:09.171 --> 00:02:09.711
Huh?

00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:14.051
What's this got to do with me?
You're just trying to act cool again.

00:02:15.761 --> 00:02:18.381
Just get to the point, okay?

00:02:18.881 --> 00:02:20.971
My master is a busy man.

00:02:20.971 --> 00:02:23.101
Summarize it in 20 words or less.

00:02:25.181 --> 00:02:27.351
I-I'm sorry.

00:02:37.361 --> 00:02:41.111
ONE PUNCH

00:02:44.821 --> 00:02:46.571
THREE, TWO, ONE, KILL SHOT

00:02:46.571 --> 00:02:50.331
JOIN THE FIGHT, CERTAIN VICTORY, THE STRONGEST EVER

00:02:46.571 --> 00:02:50.331
SANJOU, HISSHOU, SHIJOU SAIKYOU

00:02:50.331 --> 00:02:52.331
WHAT WAS THAT? FRUSTRATION

00:02:50.331 --> 00:02:52.331
NAN DATTEN DA? FRUSTRATION

00:02:52.331 --> 00:02:53.831
THERE'S NO STOPPING ME

00:02:52.331 --> 00:02:53.831
ORE WA TOMARANAI

00:02:53.831 --> 00:02:57.961
ONE PUNCH, IT'S OVER, VICTORY AFTER VICTORY

00:02:53.831 --> 00:02:57.961
ONE PUNCH, KANRYOU, RENSENRENSHOU

00:02:57.961 --> 00:03:01.591
I WIN, I ALWAYS WIN, OVERWHELMINGLY

00:02:57.961 --> 00:03:01.591
ORE WA KATSU, TSUNE NI KATSU, ASSHOU

00:03:01.591 --> 00:03:05.431
POWER, GET POWER

00:03:05.431 --> 00:03:08.391
RIGHT TO THE VERY LIMIT

00:03:05.431 --> 00:03:08.391
GIRIGIRI GENKAI MADE

00:03:08.391 --> 00:03:09.601
HERO

00:03:09.601 --> 00:03:12.771
PEOPLE SHOWER ME WITH PRAISE

00:03:09.601 --> 00:03:12.771
ORE O TATAERU KOE YA

00:03:12.771 --> 00:03:15.811
BUT I DON'T DO THIS FOR THE FAME

00:03:12.771 --> 00:03:15.811
KASSAI NANTE HOSHIKU WA NAI SA

00:03:15.811 --> 00:03:17.061
HERO

00:03:17.061 --> 00:03:21.821
SO I JUST FIGHT EVIL IN SECRET

00:03:17.061 --> 00:03:21.821
DAKARA HITOSHIREZU AKU TO TATAKAU

00:03:21.821 --> 00:03:23.281
(NOBODY KNOWS WHO HE IS)

00:03:23.281 --> 00:03:27.451
COUNTLESS ENEMIES FILL THE SKY

00:03:23.281 --> 00:03:27.451
SORA OOI OSHIYOSERU TEKI

00:03:27.451 --> 00:03:30.531
BUT I WON'T TURN MY BACK AND FLEE

00:03:27.451 --> 00:03:30.531
ORE WA SE WO MUKE WA SHINAI

00:03:30.531 --> 00:03:31.871
HERO

00:03:31.871 --> 00:03:36.871
I'VE MADE UP MY MIND AND I WON'T GIVE IN

00:03:31.871 --> 00:03:36.871
NARABA YURUGINAKI KAKUGO SHITA TAME

00:03:36.871 --> 00:03:44.091
A FIGHTING HERO

00:03:36.871 --> 00:03:44.091
TATAKAU HERO

00:03:44.091 --> 00:03:50.641
A SOLITARY HERO

00:03:44.091 --> 00:03:50.641
KODOKU NA HERO

00:03:50.641 --> 00:03:55.641
I WANNA BE THE STRONGEST HERO

00:03:50.641 --> 00:03:55.641
I WANNA BE A SAIKYOU HERO

00:03:59.611 --> 00:04:02.071
So, in other words,

00:04:02.611 --> 00:04:06.321
my boss has developed
a keen interest in your body.

00:04:07.411 --> 00:04:09.871
Too bad, I don't swing that way.

00:04:09.871 --> 00:04:11.581
I think you misunderstood, Master.

00:04:12.871 --> 00:04:15.831
He plans to use your body,
which surpasses human limitations,

00:04:16.131 --> 00:04:19.301
to further his research on evolution.

00:04:20.301 --> 00:04:23.841
If we don't do something,
I'm sure he'll try attacking us again.

00:04:24.471 --> 00:04:26.471
We cannot let him do as he pleases.

00:04:27.091 --> 00:04:29.261
Our next move should be a counterattack.

00:04:30.771 --> 00:04:32.641
Sure, let's go.

00:04:33.101 --> 00:04:33.811
Okay.

00:04:36.311 --> 00:04:36.941
Huh?

00:04:37.231 --> 00:04:38.311
Now?!

00:04:38.311 --> 00:04:40.691
Yeah, there's a sale tomorrow.

00:04:40.691 --> 00:04:42.111
Can't do it then.

00:04:42.611 --> 00:04:43.991
Master!

00:04:43.991 --> 00:04:44.951
This is bad.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:47.031
Better tell the Doctor…

00:04:47.991 --> 00:04:48.951
Hey, you.

00:04:48.951 --> 00:04:50.201
Y-Yes?

00:04:50.201 --> 00:04:52.161
I have one final question.

00:04:52.161 --> 00:04:56.751
Was the House of Evolution developing cyborgs prior to four years ago?

00:04:57.331 --> 00:04:58.961
How many more cyborgs are there?

00:04:58.961 --> 00:05:01.711
Have any of them destroyed towns in the past?

00:05:01.711 --> 00:05:03.631
I-I'm not sure,

00:05:03.631 --> 00:05:07.181
but at the House of Evolution, I'm the only combat cyborg.

00:05:10.761 --> 00:05:11.761
Impossible!

00:05:12.221 --> 00:05:16.731
Our elite force, bred to exterminate
these obsolete humans, was wiped out?!

00:05:16.731 --> 00:05:21.651
According to Armored Gorilla's report,
the two responsible are on their way here.

00:05:24.401 --> 00:05:26.571
If they come,

00:05:26.571 --> 00:05:31.031
all our research, everything we've
been working on, could be destroyed.

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:33.291
This is a serious matter.

00:05:34.251 --> 00:05:36.541
The only option is to use our trump card.

00:05:39.001 --> 00:05:42.131
Begin preparations to release Carnage Kabuto.

00:05:43.211 --> 00:05:43.801
What?!

00:05:43.801 --> 00:05:44.711
No, not him!

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:45.631
That's crazy!

00:05:45.631 --> 00:05:46.381
He'll finally be released?

00:05:46.381 --> 00:05:49.141
He's right. That might be the only way.

00:05:47.431 --> 00:05:49.141
It's still not a good idea.

00:05:49.591 --> 00:05:51.891
It's too dangerous.

00:05:51.891 --> 00:05:52.971
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:05:52.971 --> 00:05:54.141
Is this our only option?

00:05:53.641 --> 00:05:54.141
Stay calm!

00:05:54.971 --> 00:05:56.641
He will be our last resort.

00:05:57.521 --> 00:05:59.231
But…

00:05:59.231 --> 00:06:03.651
First, we'll activate all the traps on
the first floor through to the eighth.

00:06:03.651 --> 00:06:05.691
If we're lucky, they will take care of the intruders.

00:06:07.071 --> 00:06:09.411
I'm fully aware of what will happen to me

00:06:10.361 --> 00:06:11.951
should we fail.

00:06:14.911 --> 00:06:17.791
I didn't think we'd be running the whole way.

00:06:17.791 --> 00:06:19.581
How else would we get there?

00:06:19.581 --> 00:06:23.171
I was sure you would be capable of flight.

00:06:23.171 --> 00:06:25.131
Humans can't fly, you know.

00:06:25.801 --> 00:06:27.881
It's amazing that you are never late.

00:06:28.301 --> 00:06:29.971
You are a true hero.

00:06:29.971 --> 00:06:32.891
Actually, I'm almost never on time.

00:06:35.721 --> 00:06:36.721
We're here.

00:06:37.431 --> 00:06:39.481
This is the place Gorilla told us about.

00:06:40.561 --> 00:06:41.851
So this is…

00:06:41.851 --> 00:06:43.271
…the House of Evolution.

00:06:44.151 --> 00:06:46.981
One, two, three, four, five, six…

00:06:47.611 --> 00:06:49.781
Looks like it's about eight stories high.

00:07:01.121 --> 00:07:05.131
Uh… what the hell was that?

00:07:05.131 --> 00:07:06.091
Well…

00:07:06.801 --> 00:07:11.841
I decided it would be most efficient
to destroy them all in one blast.

00:07:11.841 --> 00:07:13.891
Well, that's true, but…

00:07:14.641 --> 00:07:17.181
We could've at least seen
what they had in store for us.

00:07:17.971 --> 00:07:20.391
That was kind of mean.

00:07:26.151 --> 00:07:27.731
Looks like there's a basement.

00:07:40.501 --> 00:07:43.041
S-Stop!

00:07:59.311 --> 00:08:01.811
Hey, Carnage Kabuto.

00:08:02.141 --> 00:08:04.191
Are you well?

00:08:04.191 --> 00:08:07.571
It appears you've killed a bunch of my clones again.

00:08:08.271 --> 00:08:09.861
Satisfied?

00:08:09.861 --> 00:08:10.821
Huh?

00:08:11.151 --> 00:08:15.821
Fool! You think this is enough to satisfy me?

00:08:16.121 --> 00:08:19.371
You dared to imprison me deep underground.

00:08:19.741 --> 00:08:25.671
Me! The strongest warrior in
the entire House of Evolution!

00:08:25.671 --> 00:08:28.841
You are mentally unstable.

00:08:28.841 --> 00:08:31.711
We couldn't control you, so we had no choice.

00:08:32.761 --> 00:08:34.931
Control?

00:08:36.011 --> 00:08:37.971
You moron!

00:08:37.971 --> 00:08:42.561
I'm the culmination of all your efforts
to produce a "new human."

00:08:42.561 --> 00:08:47.771
My intelligence and physical strength make me
incomparable to you obsolete humans!

00:08:47.771 --> 00:08:52.861
You should be the ones obeying me.

00:08:54.451 --> 00:08:56.991
You're wrong. You're a failure.

00:08:56.991 --> 00:09:00.661
It's true your performance is unparalleled,
but you lack humanity.

00:09:01.451 --> 00:09:03.161
Go ahead, kill me.

00:09:03.501 --> 00:09:05.661
Plenty of clones could take my place.

00:09:05.661 --> 00:09:07.331
Oh?

00:09:07.331 --> 00:09:08.671
But I have a favor to ask first.

00:09:09.751 --> 00:09:12.461
There's a specimen I must have.

00:09:14.221 --> 00:09:16.761
He is extremely strong.

00:09:16.761 --> 00:09:18.431
Only you can defeat him.

00:09:19.301 --> 00:09:21.601
I want you to catch him for me…

00:09:24.431 --> 00:09:26.351
…dead or alive.

00:09:29.151 --> 00:09:31.111
This basement is huge!

00:09:31.401 --> 00:09:32.901
I'm getting kinda fired up!

00:09:35.821 --> 00:09:36.111
Huh?

00:09:37.071 --> 00:09:38.821
I sense life-forms further ahead…

00:09:40.201 --> 00:09:43.451
Master, two of them are approaching.

00:09:46.501 --> 00:09:48.251
Oh, here we go!

00:09:48.961 --> 00:09:50.791
There are two. Which one is it?

00:09:50.791 --> 00:09:52.921
The one on the right…

00:09:52.921 --> 00:09:56.631
In that case, you don't need the one on the left!

00:09:58.511 --> 00:09:59.391
Genos?

00:10:01.101 --> 00:10:02.101
Huh?

00:10:03.141 --> 00:10:03.811
Hello?

00:10:05.851 --> 00:10:08.691
I am Carnage Kabuto!

00:10:08.691 --> 00:10:11.611
We've got a combat experimentation room.

00:10:12.231 --> 00:10:15.111
Let's let loose in there.

00:10:15.481 --> 00:10:18.361
You turned Genos into a piece of modern art.

00:10:19.951 --> 00:10:21.371
Bring it on!

00:10:30.251 --> 00:10:31.751
Pretty big, eh?

00:10:32.041 --> 00:10:35.001
It's the biggest room in the facility.

00:10:35.001 --> 00:10:41.011
This is where they make us fight to test our combat abilities.

00:10:41.591 --> 00:10:45.261
Well then, let the slaughter begin.

00:10:48.431 --> 00:10:49.101
Oh?

00:10:49.771 --> 00:10:52.101
Still alive, huh?

00:11:13.581 --> 00:11:16.461
You fool!

00:11:16.801 --> 00:11:18.211
Machine Gun Blows!

00:11:31.891 --> 00:11:33.231
He got me.

00:11:33.851 --> 00:11:35.021
Let me…

00:11:36.231 --> 00:11:37.111
…take him…

00:11:37.781 --> 00:11:41.071
Your face is all cracked. Don't push yourself.

00:11:48.701 --> 00:11:50.621
With his breath? Impossible!

00:11:55.751 --> 00:11:57.541
Genos, you okay?

00:11:57.541 --> 00:11:59.301
Yes…

00:12:01.011 --> 00:12:03.261
No, you're not! Look at your head!

00:12:10.101 --> 00:12:13.811
You've gone and gotten my hopes up.

00:12:34.051 --> 00:12:39.171
I have always been critical of humans
and their inferior abilities.

00:12:39.791 --> 00:12:44.761
The entire species, myself excluded,
is nothing more than dumb animals.

00:12:45.261 --> 00:12:47.801
That realization was agonizing.

00:12:48.261 --> 00:12:51.561
If memory serves, I was 15 when it occurred to me.

00:12:52.431 --> 00:12:55.101
A plan to evolve the human species

00:12:55.101 --> 00:12:58.941
and create a world where I could live contentedly.

00:12:58.941 --> 00:13:03.231
A utopia of my own creation, just for me.

00:13:03.231 --> 00:13:09.831
A world made up of only us, a new breed of human that will transcend humanity!

00:13:18.161 --> 00:13:19.591
I must see it through.

00:13:21.131 --> 00:13:26.971
Compared to my anguish back then,
the physical pain I feel now is nothing.

00:13:27.711 --> 00:13:30.721
What's the holdup? Let's go!

00:13:30.721 --> 00:13:32.431
Show me everything you've got.

00:13:33.851 --> 00:13:36.061
Carnage Kabuto, a demon incarnate.

00:13:36.061 --> 00:13:38.851
The strongest and most brutal creation
of the House of Evolution.

00:13:39.691 --> 00:13:42.981
Let's see how you, at your
archaic stage of human development,

00:13:42.981 --> 00:13:46.361
fare against the pinnacle of artificial evolution.

00:13:46.861 --> 00:13:51.121
Will you be the spark for a new era of evolution?

00:13:52.201 --> 00:13:54.241
I can't wait to find out!

00:13:57.371 --> 00:14:00.711
Oh, I get it. I get it!

00:14:00.711 --> 00:14:02.621
You're supposed to be strong.

00:14:02.621 --> 00:14:04.131
Don't disappoint me now.

00:14:04.751 --> 00:14:07.501
You're this place's ultimate weapon, right?

00:14:07.501 --> 00:14:09.891
You're clearly not the same as the guys from this morning.

00:14:10.421 --> 00:14:13.011
Look at you, just oozing with confidence.

00:14:18.141 --> 00:14:19.141
Such speed!

00:14:29.401 --> 00:14:30.491
What are you doing?

00:14:31.951 --> 00:14:32.491
Hey.

00:14:36.031 --> 00:14:37.491
He backed off?

00:14:37.491 --> 00:14:39.291
Carnage Kabuto backed off?!

00:14:40.701 --> 00:14:43.671
If I'd attacked him just now,
he would've killed me!

00:14:44.541 --> 00:14:46.801
Who the hell is this guy?

00:14:47.251 --> 00:14:49.381
He's leaving himself wide open,

00:14:49.381 --> 00:14:54.011
yet all my instincts are screaming out danger!

00:14:54.011 --> 00:14:54.811
Huh?

00:14:54.811 --> 00:14:57.061
You bastard!

00:14:57.391 --> 00:15:03.061
How the hell did you get so strong?!

00:15:10.981 --> 00:15:12.741
So you wanna know too?

00:15:14.281 --> 00:15:15.281
Okay, fine.

00:15:17.821 --> 00:15:19.581
Genos, you listen carefully too.

00:15:20.951 --> 00:15:22.831
He's going to tell us right now?!

00:15:23.371 --> 00:15:26.791
The secret to his power?

00:15:26.791 --> 00:15:28.211
I'd like to know, too.

00:15:29.961 --> 00:15:30.511
Huh?

00:15:31.001 --> 00:15:31.961
Who are you?

00:15:31.961 --> 00:15:33.221
I am Genus.

00:15:36.261 --> 00:15:39.511
Well, fine. Listen up.

00:15:39.891 --> 00:15:40.931
It's too risky!

00:15:41.561 --> 00:15:43.931
Is it really okay for these guys to hear it?

00:15:44.891 --> 00:15:46.401
First of all,

00:15:46.811 --> 00:15:50.521
you need to make sure to stick
to this intense training regimen.

00:15:51.821 --> 00:15:53.651
Training?

00:15:53.651 --> 00:15:56.281
Not augmentation surgery or genetic enhancement?

00:15:56.281 --> 00:15:58.161
Training?!

00:15:58.161 --> 00:16:00.661
What kind of…?

00:16:02.621 --> 00:16:04.291
Listen up, Genos.

00:16:05.461 --> 00:16:06.871
You just have to keep at it.

00:16:08.631 --> 00:16:10.501
No matter how hard it gets.

00:16:11.751 --> 00:16:14.511
It took me three years to get this strong.

00:16:16.341 --> 00:16:18.641
One hundred push-ups!

00:16:18.641 --> 00:16:20.931
One hundred sit-ups!

00:16:20.931 --> 00:16:22.101
One hundred squats!

00:16:23.441 --> 00:16:25.691
Then a ten-kilometer run!

00:16:26.061 --> 00:16:28.191
Every single day!

00:16:36.821 --> 00:16:39.581
And of course, make sure you eat three meals a day.

00:16:40.531 --> 00:16:42.701
For breakfast, just a banana's fine.

00:16:42.701 --> 00:16:45.751
But the most important thing is to
never use the A/C in summer

00:16:43.291 --> 00:16:49.041
Save

00:16:43.291 --> 00:16:49.041
money

00:16:45.751 --> 00:16:49.041
or the heater in winter, so that you can strengthen the mind.

00:16:53.001 --> 00:16:55.431
In the beginning, you'll wish you were dead.

00:16:56.211 --> 00:16:59.931
You might start thinking,
"What's the harm in taking a day off?"

00:17:01.221 --> 00:17:05.101
But for me, in order to be a strong hero,

00:17:05.101 --> 00:17:09.691
no matter how tough it was,
even if I was spitting blood, I never stopped.

00:17:10.481 --> 00:17:13.691
I kept doing squats even when my legs felt so heavy they refused to move.

00:17:14.401 --> 00:17:17.281
Even when my arms started
making weird clicking noises,

00:17:17.281 --> 00:17:19.151
I kept doing push-ups.

00:17:20.911 --> 00:17:24.041
A year and a half later,
I started to notice a difference.

00:17:24.331 --> 00:17:25.951
I was bald…

00:17:26.541 --> 00:17:28.581
And I had become stronger!

00:17:30.081 --> 00:17:34.801
In other words, you gotta train like hell
until your hair falls out.

00:17:35.091 --> 00:17:38.091
That's the only way to become strong.

00:17:40.051 --> 00:17:44.221
Anyone just screwing with evolution
and trying to create a "new human race"

00:17:44.221 --> 00:17:46.771
will never make it this far.

00:17:47.221 --> 00:17:50.481
The ability to grow and adapt
is humanity's greatest strength!

00:17:51.231 --> 00:17:53.781
Wh-What?

00:17:53.781 --> 00:17:55.781
Is this guy… for real?

00:17:56.651 --> 00:17:57.861
Master…

00:17:59.241 --> 00:18:00.821
You are so…

00:18:02.161 --> 00:18:03.821
full of crap!

00:18:03.821 --> 00:18:04.411
Huh?

00:18:04.991 --> 00:18:07.991
That's just ordinary strength training!

00:18:09.041 --> 00:18:10.961
And it's not even that intense!

00:18:11.541 --> 00:18:13.381
Anyone could do it!

00:18:13.381 --> 00:18:13.671
I…

00:18:14.581 --> 00:18:17.051
I have to get stronger!

00:18:17.051 --> 00:18:21.641
I didn't ask to study under you so I could listen to your jokes!

00:18:23.641 --> 00:18:26.051
Master Saitama, your power…

00:18:26.051 --> 00:18:29.391
is clearly beyond what you can achieve
by just training your body!

00:18:29.391 --> 00:18:32.151
That's right, I want to know your—

00:18:32.561 --> 00:18:34.981
We want to know your true secret!

00:18:37.071 --> 00:18:38.111
Genos…

00:18:39.691 --> 00:18:42.821
You may not believe me,
but that's really all I did.

00:18:43.861 --> 00:18:45.621
Oh yeah?

00:18:49.411 --> 00:18:50.831
No! Carnage Kabuto!

00:18:51.581 --> 00:18:56.341
If you don't wanna tell us your secret, so be it.

00:18:57.711 --> 00:19:00.761
Stop! You'll go on another rampage!

00:19:01.171 --> 00:19:04.761
I bet you aren't stronger than me anyway!

00:19:08.481 --> 00:19:13.401
But, since you pissed me off,

00:19:13.811 --> 00:19:16.151
I'm gonna annihilate you.

00:19:18.111 --> 00:19:20.611
CARNAGE MODE

00:19:18.111 --> 00:19:20.611
Carnage Mode!

00:19:26.451 --> 00:19:30.701
When I get like this, I lose my mind for a whole week

00:19:30.701 --> 00:19:33.581
and my bloodthirst can't be quenched!

00:19:33.581 --> 00:19:41.591
After I kill you, I'll head into town and
go on a killing rampage until next Saturday!

00:19:43.011 --> 00:19:47.181
If you're such a powerful hero,
then just try and stop me!

00:20:00.861 --> 00:20:03.361
No way… It can't be…

00:20:10.951 --> 00:20:12.121
Master?!

00:20:13.121 --> 00:20:17.751
Dammit. I might've made a horrible mistake.

00:20:20.751 --> 00:20:22.591
This guy's in Carnage Mode.

00:20:23.671 --> 00:20:27.131
He said he'll be on a rampage for a whole week.

00:20:28.721 --> 00:20:31.221
Die, die, die, die, die, die,

00:20:31.221 --> 00:20:33.931
Die, die, die, die, die!

00:20:33.931 --> 00:20:37.021
He'll be like this till next Saturday?

00:20:37.861 --> 00:20:39.521
One whole week from today…

00:20:41.401 --> 00:20:42.741
Next Saturday…

00:20:44.111 --> 00:20:47.991
In other words, today is Saturday too!

00:20:48.821 --> 00:20:50.451
That means…

00:20:50.451 --> 00:20:52.501
It's all over.

00:20:52.501 --> 00:20:56.251
There's no one in the world that can stop him.

00:20:57.661 --> 00:20:58.501
That means…

00:20:59.621 --> 00:21:01.001
Today is…

00:21:01.331 --> 00:21:07.221
Bargain day at the supermarket!

00:21:17.061 --> 00:21:19.021
Who the hell is this guy?

00:21:19.021 --> 00:21:22.941
God damn it!

00:21:22.941 --> 00:21:24.271
What is he—

00:21:24.271 --> 00:21:28.031
I believe he is upset about this.

00:21:28.871 --> 00:21:31.581
Saturday

00:21:28.871 --> 00:21:31.581
Only

00:21:28.871 --> 00:21:31.581
Gigantic Sale!

00:21:30.661 --> 00:21:33.201
Master, the store closes at 10 PM.

00:21:34.081 --> 00:21:36.451
It takes about four hours to get there.

00:21:36.451 --> 00:21:38.791
If we really hurry, we can make it.

00:21:39.581 --> 00:21:41.791
I'll make it if I hurry?

00:21:41.791 --> 00:21:42.541
Yes!

00:21:42.541 --> 00:21:43.631
Let's go, Genos!

00:21:43.631 --> 00:21:44.711
Yes, Master!

00:21:45.801 --> 00:21:49.341
I think I'm done with evolution.

00:21:51.721 --> 00:21:56.101
It appears that the one who must change… is me.

00:22:01.771 --> 00:22:08.031
Hey, come back home soon

00:22:01.771 --> 00:22:08.031
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:22:15.331 --> 00:22:21.251
When my worries keep me awake under the crescent moon

00:22:15.331 --> 00:22:21.251
tameiki ga mikazuki wo yurasu yoru wa

00:22:21.251 --> 00:22:27.381
All I can do is close my eyes and think of you

00:22:21.251 --> 00:22:27.381
me wo tojite kimi no koto kangaete bakari

00:22:27.381 --> 00:22:30.431
I want to see you, I feel like crying

00:22:27.381 --> 00:22:30.431
aitai kibun nakitai kibun

00:22:30.431 --> 00:22:32.931
I feel so romantic

00:22:30.431 --> 00:22:32.931
romantikku na kibun

00:22:32.931 --> 00:22:39.481
I hope my feelings reach you

00:22:32.931 --> 00:22:39.481
todokete kono omoi

00:22:39.941 --> 00:22:48.241
I know so very well

00:22:39.941 --> 00:22:48.241
datte zutto shitteiru no

00:22:48.241 --> 00:22:53.451
how hard you always work

00:22:48.241 --> 00:22:53.451
ganbatteru koto takusan

00:22:55.161 --> 00:22:58.121
You're the one I love

00:22:55.161 --> 00:22:58.121
daisuki na hito ga

00:22:58.121 --> 00:23:01.251
You're so strong, yet still I worry

00:22:58.121 --> 00:23:01.251
tsuyokute shinpai

00:23:01.251 --> 00:23:07.211
Only I ever see your weakness

00:23:01.251 --> 00:23:07.211
watashi ni dake wa yowasa misete

00:23:07.211 --> 00:23:13.261
I'll find you before the stars

00:23:07.211 --> 00:23:13.261
hoshi yori saki ni mitsukete ageru

00:23:13.261 --> 00:23:19.101
Come right back home

00:23:13.261 --> 00:23:19.101
massugu kaette kite ne

00:23:19.101 --> 00:23:27.321
Hey, come back home soon

00:23:19.101 --> 00:23:27.321
nee hayaku kaette kite ne

00:23:32.441 --> 00:23:33.071
Yes.

00:23:33.571 --> 00:23:35.741
The on-site investigation is underway.

00:23:36.611 --> 00:23:38.831
Yes, that's correct.

00:23:39.161 --> 00:23:43.121
Just like the other cases,
the site is scorched by intense flames.

00:23:43.541 --> 00:23:48.131
Everything points to the young cyborg
being responsible for this.

00:23:48.791 --> 00:23:50.461
Yes, understood.

00:23:52.551 --> 00:23:55.801
Such devastating power.

00:23:57.391 --> 00:23:58.141
Yeah.

00:24:00.101 --> 00:24:20.121
NEXT
TIME

00:24:00.101 --> 00:24:20.121
THE
MODERN
NINJA

00:24:00.641 --> 00:24:02.271
Yo, this is Carnage Kabuto.

00:24:02.271 --> 00:24:04.141
In Japanese, my name is "Ashura Kabuto,"

00:24:04.141 --> 00:24:09.191
written with the kanji for "shell,"
"field trip," and the Sanskrit word "Om."

00:24:09.191 --> 00:24:10.441
Whaddaya think?

00:24:10.441 --> 00:24:11.941
Bet you don't give a damn!

00:24:11.941 --> 00:24:13.931
Next time, on One Punch Man : Episode 4,

00:24:13.931 --> 00:24:15.321
"The Modern Ninja."

00:24:16.571 --> 00:24:20.121
So that guy's finally gonna show up?
